{"page": 3, "kind": "cell", "table": 1, "row": 24, "col": 4, "x": null, "text": "• Perspectives: Asian immigrant workers, international response, Native Hawaiian resistance, oligarchy (Dole, Thurston), U.S. responses (e.g., political, economic)", "id": "u68", "furniture": false}
